lve into vast oceans, and\neerie green light floods the skies.\n\nBraving the unknown, penguin astronauts\nCAPTAIN PEBBLESWORTH and MAJOR BEEKMAN\nembark on a perilous mission to uncover the truth\u2026\n\nAstro Penguin is a VR platformer. Penguin astronauts have a range of locomotion abilities. They can slide, swim, glide, flap, carve, surf, rocket, grind, (stay tuned for more!). Explore Mars with realistic-feeling movement: feel the wind on your wings."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.interlacevr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.interlacevr.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Interlace VR LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.interlacevr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "27674069382230626"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820648_1528690981585532_3469938803066902405_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ln_3LD5zl_EQ7kNvwHgdGWG&_nc_oc=AdpY-P4_72rXyqQUE6wzZAyPtFaTMiFaquab4x_4Z2YsExqPknpRpbtCo2WzqtOhdFA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1xc4lzWFH4lUYWlhbeincEwHbtDeHSByVpRo656s26_A&oe=69E8DF5C"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "i